{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Synopsis:</i>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Richard Hartman, a 16-year-old wakes up trapped in hell. Kidnapped and forced into sinister experiments, he finds himself subjected to deadly trials and grotesque traps, trapped in the most disturbing places imaginable consumed by infection and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by a 15-year-old developer</strong>, PLAGUE: Outbreak immerses you in intense survival horror:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every bullet counts</strong> \u2013 Ammo and resources force you to think before you shoot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive horror</strong> \u2013 Explore blood-soaked corridors and abandoned facilities filled with unspeakable terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive as you can</strong> \u2013 You can\u2019t always fight, sometimes running is your only option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror</strong> \u2013 The infection not only kills you but slowly consumes your mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original narrative</strong> \u2013\u00a0A fresh and unique story in the survival horror genre...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly trials and traps</strong> \u2013 Face twisted experiments and life-or-death  trials that push you to the very edge of death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the truth</strong> \u2013 Solve puzzles and uncover the secrets behind the outbreak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lethal enemies</strong> \u2013 From infected zombies to aberrations born in laboratories, each encounter can be your last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infection spreads...<br><strong>Will you survive the outbreak?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973320?t=1757762953","backgrou